{"path":"experimental/future/operator=","title":"std::experimental::future<T>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::future&lt;T&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/future/operator=","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Assigns the contents of another future object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/future\"><span class=\"kw2771\">std::<span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">future</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/future\"><span class=\"kw2771\">std::<span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">future</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/future\"><span class=\"kw2771\">std::<span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">future</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/future\"><span class=\"kw2771\">std::<span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">future</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span